# AGENTS.md - NeoRunner Implementation Plan

## Overview
This is the canonical knowledge base for the NeoRunner project - Minecraft modded server manager.

## Dynamic Version System
ALL Minecraft version references must use the version module:


## Phase 1: Crash Log Analyzer (Client-Side Analysis)
Analyzes CLIENT crash logs to identify issues and auto-fetch missing mods.

| Error Type | Detection Pattern | Server Has Mod? | Action |
|-----------|-------------------|-----------------|--------|
| Missing Dependency | requires mod X | NO | Fetch X → clientonly/ |
| Missing Dependency | requires mod X | YES (diff version) | Resync |
| Client-Only Mod | net.minecraft.client.* | - | Flag |
| Java Version | Class version 65 | - | Warn |

## Phase 2: Network Channel Logging (Server-Side)
- Always-on monitoring every 5 seconds
- Parse logs for: Unknown custom packet identifier, Channel not registered

