## Known Issues Fixed
1. Python 3.14 dataclass bug → add  to config.py
2. Relative import issues → use importlib.util.spec_from_file_location() with module.__package__ = ''
3. IP detection 127.x → skip 169.254 too
4. World version unknown → parse level.dat properly

